<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TriNet Corporate Realty.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TriNet Corporate Realty.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jefferies &amp; Co Inc said analyst Judy Hedin raised her rating on TriNet Corporate Realty Trust to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Further details were unavailable.</p>
<p>-- TriNet was off 3/4 at 33-3/8.</p>
</text>
